BOOKING CONFIRMATION
====================

Dear <%= @guest.first_name %>,

We're delighted to confirm your reservation at <%= @hotel.name %>. We look forward to welcoming you!

CONFIRMATION NUMBER: <%= @reservation.confirmation_number %>
Please save this number for your records.

RESERVATION DETAILS
-------------------
Guest Name: <%= @guest.full_name %>
Check-in Date: <%= @reservation.check_in_date.strftime("%A, %B %d, %Y") %>
Check-out Date: <%= @reservation.check_out_date.strftime("%A, %B %d, %Y") %>
Number of Nights: <%= @reservation.nights %>
Room Type: <%= @room_type.name %>
Number of Guests: <%= pluralize(@reservation.adults, 'Adult') %><% if @reservation.children > 0 %>, <%= pluralize(@reservation.children, 'Child', 'Children') %><% end %>
Total Amount: $<%= @reservation.total_amount.to_i %> <%= @reservation.currency %>
Payment Status: <%= @reservation.payment_status.humanize %>

<% if @reservation.special_requests.present? %>
SPECIAL REQUESTS
----------------
<%= @reservation.special_requests %>
Note: Special requests are subject to availability and cannot be guaranteed.

<% end %>
HOTEL INFORMATION
-----------------
<%= @hotel.name %>
<%= @hotel.address %>
<%= @hotel.city %>, <%= @hotel.state %> <%= @hotel.postal_code %>
<%= @hotel.country %>

Phone: <%= @hotel.phone %>
Email: <%= @hotel.email %>

Check-in Time: After <%= @hotel.check_in_time.strftime("%l:%M %p") %>
Check-out Time: Before <%= @hotel.check_out_time.strftime("%l:%M %p") %>

IMPORTANT INFORMATION
---------------------
• Please present this confirmation and a valid photo ID at check-in
• A credit card will be required at check-in for incidentals
• Modifications can be made up to 24 hours before check-in
• Cancellation policy: Free cancellation up to 7 days before check-in

To view or manage your reservation online, visit:
<%= public_reservation_url(@reservation.confirmation_number, email: @guest.email) %>

If you need to modify or cancel your reservation, you can do so online using the link above or by contacting the hotel directly.

We look forward to making your stay memorable!

Best regards,
<%= @hotel.name %> Team

